579						? `Nothing was prepended to PATH and this stage was handed no era-cell provision, so the child inherited the invoking PATH unchanged. \`resolvedVersion\` is \`node -v\` read through that environment${resolvedVersion === null ? ', and it read nothing: `node` was not resolvable there' : ''}; which runtime that is was decided outside this pipeline.`
